# Paths deleted from the vendored subcharts after `helm dependency update`.
# One path per line, relative to this chart directory. Comments with #.
#
# The upstream chart offers postgresql as an alternative backend, bundled as a
# conditional dependency. We run ERPNext on MariaDB (see the mariadb block in
# values.yaml, served by mariadb-operator), so postgresql.enabled stays false
# and the bundled copy renders nothing. The published tarball carries it
# regardless, which is why this file exists: without it the subchart comes back
# on the next version bump.
charts/erpnext/charts/postgresql
